  "description": "Who am I?!\n\nSaved by Seol-Ji, Gu-Nak awakens from amnesia. Following his time as a traveling troupe, Gu-Nak travels the world as a guest. The mysterious human weapons pursue him, and the assassins' continued slaughter unfolds. The plots and conspiracies of the Sima Akdos target the Great Heaven, and the true nature of the human weapons is finally revealed! The world is a phantom butterfly dream. If this is a dream, may it never wake up!!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
